# KDE Plasma edition (default): best Wayland + gaming + HiDPI story.

plasma-desktop
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
plasma-systemmonitor
plasma-workspace-wallpapers
powerdevil
kscreen
kinfocenter
kwalletmanager
sddm
sddm-kcm

# The X server for the Plasma X11 session (the one live-setup autologins into)
# and for SDDM's default greeter. The built-in modesetting driver covers
# virtio-gpu/QXL/VGA in a VM and Intel/AMD/nouveau on bare metal;
# xf86-input-libinput gives X a working mouse and keyboard.
xorg-server
xorg-xinit
xorg-xauth
xf86-input-libinput
breeze-gtk
breeze-icons
gnome-themes-extra
xdg-desktop-portal-kde
xdg-user-dirs
yad          # GTK dialogs: powers the graphical Software installer
ttf-liberation  # metric-compatible with Arial/Times/Courier (Office/web)

dolphin
konsole
kate
ark
spectacle
gwenview
okular
partitionmanager

# graphical app store, so installing software needs no terminal
discover
packagekit
